71-1.71"></path></svg></button></div></div></h1><p><span>Before discussing =
four main approaches to building and improving reasoning models in the next=
 section, I want to briefly outline the DeepSeek R1 pipeline, as described =
in the</span><a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.12948" rel=3D""> DeepSee=
k R1 technical report</a><span>. This report serves as both an interesting =
case study and a blueprint for developing reasoning LLMs.</span></p><p>Note=
 that DeepSeek did not release a single R1 reasoning model but instead intr=
