4 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></=
button></div></div></h1><p>In this section, I will outline the key techniqu=
es currently used to enhance the reasoning capabilities of LLMs and to buil=
d specialized reasoning models such as DeepSeek-R1, OpenAI's o1 &amp; o3, a=
nd others.</p><p>Note: The exact workings of o1 and o3 remain unknown outsi=
de of OpenAI. However, they are rumored to leverage a combination of both i=
nference and training techniques.</p><h2 class=3D"header-anchor-post"><stro=
ng>1) Inference-time scaling</strong><div class=3D"pencraft pc-display-flex=
 pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent"><=
div class=3D"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA"><div id=
=3D"=C2=A71-inference-time-scaling" class=3D"pencraft pc-reset header-ancho=
r offset-top"></div><button type=3D"button" aria-label=3D"Link" data-href=
